# GS23: Roman and sound content (2026-10-23). Metadata scouted live: every
# page was opened and every file's md5 is of the bytes that URL served on
# 2026-10-23. Rows are licence-checked: CC0, or CC-BY 3.0 with the required
# attribution text at the end of the row (the tool refuses a CC-BY row that
# has none, and writes the text into the license sidecar). No NC, no ND.
#
# Format: <source> <id> <url> [md5] [license] [author] [attribution text]
# (tools/fetch-content.mjs).
#
# --- 4 Roman props, glb (Poly Pizza, CC-BY 3.0) ---
# Each model page states "Licence: CC-BY 3.0" and names the creator:
#   Coliseum        poly.pizza/m/4raJTBfhAfc  Poly by Google  24,153 tris
#   Roman Centurion poly.pizza/m/g2ckFsGszB  blaeksprut       2,346 tris
#   roman legionnaire grunt poly.pizza/m/czyveAaJ0hd Warren Blyth 1,064 tris
#   Roman Arch      poly.pizza/m/agiRDMN0VR  Icawfype        5,198 tris
#     (the page's Tris field reads 0; the glb holds one mesh, 5,198 tris,
#     5,198 x 3 indices, one material, no images - checked in the bytes.)
# CC-BY 3.0 needs credit: the attribution text is part of the row.
