# --- 6 Roman and crowd sounds (Freesound, CC0) ---
# Each page states "Creative Commons 0" and names its uploader; the files
# below are the public hq preview mp3s the page serves (cdn.freesound.org).
# The original wav the row asks for comes from the API with FREESOUND_TOKEN
# (OAuth2), which this seat does not have:
#   freesound.org/apiv2/sounds/264377/ -> 401
#   {"detail":"Authentication credentials were not provided."}
