# --- 2 sword sound packs, zip (OpenGameArt, CC0) ---
# opengameart.org/content/20-sword-sound-effects-attacks-and-clashes states
# CC0 ("creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/") and StarNinjas as the
# uploader: ten sword attacks and ten sword clashes, one zip each. The pack's
# notice asks for a link to the author's profile; that is a request, not a
# CC-BY condition, so the rows stay CC0.
url oga_sword_attacks https://opengameart.org/sites/default/files/sword_-_starninjas_1.zip df2bdfa83a1751ff02d6e90c774b0bd4 CC0 StarNinjas
