#
# --- Sketchfab rows: landed 2026-10-24 (17 models, CC-BY, token on the seat) ---
# No `url` line here: tools/fetch-content.mjs sends no Authorization header, and
# the Sketchfab download endpoint answers 401 without one. These were fetched
# with GET /v3/models/{uid}/download plus `Authorization: Token $SKETCHFAB_TOKEN`
# (the token is an env var, never in the tree), decimated headless in Blender to
# the prop budget, and landed with their own table in
# content/props/sketchfab/PROVENANCE.md (id, author, licence, url, bytes, tris,
# sha256) and attribution lines in content/props/sketchfab/CREDITS.md.
#
#   gladius   b123c4388a6f4307aff353c165c94f92  DireRaven      -> gladius_direraven.glb 1500 tris
